The '''Manarai range''' was a [[mountain]] range located on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. Its highest peak was [[Umate]]. Over time, as Coruscant was transformed into an [[ecumenopolis]], the planet-spanning [[city]] covered the entire Manarai range except for Umate, the peak of which became the centrepiece of [[Monument Plaza]].<ref name="Light of the Jedi" />

